        Cell["Paint supplies the actual inserted FeynArts diagrams. The four \
numbers identify the contact and three exchange contributions; they are not \
extra multiplicative weights. FeynArts already supplies the graph factors.", 
         "Text", ExpressionUUID -> "d300d3e2-1441-4454-b220-221ff9c5c3ae"]}, 
       Open]], Cell[CellGroupData[
       {Cell["3. Build the four off-shell amplitudes", "Section", 
         ExpressionUUID -> "abf8b48b-3f95-4714-ba67-0a4717f65159"], 
        Cell["Use incoming momenta p1,p2 and outgoing momenta p3,p4. All \
virtualities and scalar products remain symbolic. MomentumConservation -> \
True supplies internal routing at each vertex without imposing mass-shell \
conditions or eliminating an external momentum. Truncated -> True removes \
external propagators; polarisations are attached explicitly in the next \
cell.", "Text", ExpressionUUID -> "ed144ddd-09e4-41e1-a993-199ac60484cc"], 
        Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{RowBox[{"treeRawAmplitude", 
